{
  "id": "fox-shffl-shine-grab",
  "name": "SHFFL shine grab",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": [
    "fox"
  ],
  "goal": "SHFFL an aerial, shine as you land, then grab.",
  "why": "An opponent who holds shield through the aerial and the shine is open to a grab. Jumping out of the shine and grabbing in the jump squat turns the pressure into a grab {4} frames after the shine, without leaving the ground.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 90,
      "height": 8
    },
    "what": "A SHFFL shine grab is a SHFFL, a shine on the first frame after the landing lag, a jump out of the shine on its frame {4}, and Z on the next frame of the jump squat.",
    "expect": "Each attempt is judged when the grab comes out: the SHFFL, the shine's timing after the landing lag, the jump out of the shine and the grab. After misses, the coach shows your inputs frame by frame against these frames.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": "J+1",
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": "SA",
        "hold": 3
      },
      {
        "press": "L",
        "frame": "SA+2",
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 24
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 24
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 27,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "Z",
        "frame": 28,
        "hold": 1
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: X tapped. Short hop",
      "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: A. Neutral air",
      "SA": "Frame {SA}: stick down. Fast fall",
      "SA+2": "Frame {SA+2}: L",
      "SA+3": "Frame {SA+3}: landed. {7} frames of landing lag",
      "SA+10": "Frame {SA+10}: down-B. Shine",
      "SA+13": "Frame {SA+13}: X. Jump out of the shine",
      "SA+14": "Frame {SA+14}: Z. Grab"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "The SHFFL",
        "text": [
          "A SHFFL is a short hop, an aerial, a fast fall and an L-cancel. The aerial is pressed on frame {J+1}, the first frame in the air, and the fast fall at the top of the short hop, frame {SA}, so Fox lands with the aerial still out.",
          "Landing during an aerial gives its landing lag: {15} frames for neutral air, {18} for down air. L, R or Z pressed on the landing frame or on any of the {6} frames before it halves it: {7} and {9} frames."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": "SA",
                "hold": 3
              },
              {
                "press": "L",
                "frame": "SA+2",
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: X tapped. Short hop",
              "J+1": "Frame {J+1}: A. Neutral air",
              "SA": "Frame {SA}: the top. Stick tapped down: fast fall",
              "SA+2": "Frame {SA+2}: L pressed",
              "SA+3": "Frame {SA+3}: landed. Landing lag {7} frames",
              "SA+10": "Frame {SA+10}: free to act"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "Jump squat",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "SA-4"
                ],
                "words": "Neutral air",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA-3",
                  "SA+3"
                ],
                "words": "Press L now: L-cancel",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+4",
                  "SA+9"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+10",
                  "SA+20"
                ],
                "words": "Free to act",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Shine as the landing lag ends",
        "text": [
          "Landing lag cannot be cancelled: down-B pressed during it is ignored, and holding it does not carry the press over. The shine comes out when down-B is pressed on the first frame after the lag, frame {SA+10} here.",
          "The lag depends on the aerial: an L-cancelled neutral air ends {7} frames after landing, a down air {9}, a back air {10}, a forward air {11}."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "J+1",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": "SA",
                "hold": 3
              },
              {
                "press": "L",
                "frame": "SA+2",
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 24
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 24
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "SA+3": "Frame {SA+3}: landed, L-cancelled",
              "SA+4": "Frame {f}: landing lag. Down-B now is ignored",
              "SA+10": "Frame {SA+10}: down-B. The shine comes out",
              "SA+11": "Frame {f}: shine"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+3",
                  "SA+9"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag: a shine is ignored",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+10",
                  "SA+10"
                ],
                "words": "Shine now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA+11",
                  "SA+24"
                ],
                "words": "Shine",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Grab out of the shine",
        "text": [
          "The shine accepts a jump from its fourth frame, and nothing else. The jump squat that follows accepts a grab: Z pressed on its second or third frame replaces the jump with a standing grab, so Fox never leaves the ground.",
          "Z pressed together with the jump out of the shine is not seen, and Fox jumps. Z pressed once he is in the air is a neutral air."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 4,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "Z",
                "frame": 5,
                "hold": 1
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: down-B. The shine",
              "4": "Frame {4}: X. The jump squat begins",
              "5": "Frame {5}: Z. The jump squat becomes a grab",
              "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: grabbing"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  3
                ],
                "words": "Too soon: a jump is ignored",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  4,
                  4
                ],
                "words": "Jump now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  5,
                  "J+3"
                ],
                "words": "Press Z now: grab",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+4",
                  "J+24"
                ],
                "words": "Grabbing",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
